      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In spite of a substantial increase in the use of bisphosphonates at child bearing age, very little is known regarding its use in pregnancy. We describe the outcome of 24 pregnancies after pre-pregnancy or early pregnancy alendronate therapy. Based on the pregnancy outcome it seems that alendronate does not impose a major teratogenic risk."},
